      <p data-en="Even at this modest volume — a solo barber bringing in 10 new clients a month at $50 each — the commission model costs more than 5× as much per month as a flat-rate subscription." data-fr="Même à ce volume modeste — un barbier solo accueillant 10 nouveaux clients par mois à 50$ chacun — le modèle à commission coûte plus de 5 fois plus cher par mois qu'un abonnement à tarif fixe.">Even at this modest volume — a solo barber bringing in 10 new clients a month at $50 each — the commission model costs more than 5× as much per month as a flat-rate subscription.</p>

