      <h2 data-en="The Break-Even Point: When Does Commission Start Costing More?" data-fr="Le point mort : quand la commission coûte-t-elle plus cher?">The Break-Even Point: When Does Commission Start Costing More?</h2>

      <p data-en="With a flat-rate app at $19/month and a 20% commission model, the math is straightforward. You reach break-even — the point where commission costs exactly as much as flat-rate — at these volumes:" data-fr="Avec une application à tarif fixe à 19$/mois et un modèle de commission à 20%, le calcul est simple. Vous atteignez le seuil de rentabilité — le point où la commission coûte exactement autant que le tarif fixe — à ces volumes :">With a flat-rate app at $19/month and a 20% commission model, the math is straightforward. You reach break-even — the point where commission costs exactly as much as flat-rate — at these volumes:</p>

      <ul>
        <li data-en="$50 average service: 2 new clients/month ($50 × 2 × 20% = $20 ≈ $19)" data-fr="Service moyen de 50$ : 2 nouveaux clients/mois (50$ × 2 × 20% = 20$ ≈ 19$)"><strong>$50 average service:</strong> 2 new clients/month ($50 × 2 × 20% = $20 ≈ $19)</li>
        <li data-en="$60 average service: 2 new clients/month ($60 × 2 × 20% = $24 > $19)" data-fr="Service moyen de 60$ : 2 nouveaux clients/mois (60$ × 2 × 20% = 24$ > 19$)"><strong>$60 average service:</strong> 2 new clients/month ($60 × 2 × 20% = $24 &gt; $19)</li>
        <li data-en="$80 average service: 2 new clients/month ($80 × 2 × 20% = $32 > $19)" data-fr="Service moyen de 80$ : 2 nouveaux clients/mois (80$ × 2 × 20% = 32$ > 19$)"><strong>$80 average service:</strong> 2 new clients/month ($80 × 2 × 20% = $32 &gt; $19)</li>
        <li data-en="$100 average service: 1 new client/month ($100 × 1 × 20% = $20 > $19)" data-fr="Service moyen de 100$ : 1 nouveau client/mois (100$ × 1 × 20% = 20$ > 19$)"><strong>$100 average service:</strong> 1 new client/month ($100 × 1 × 20% = $20 &gt; $19)</li>
      </ul>

      <p data-en="In plain terms: if your shop attracts more than 2 new clients per month — at any typical service price — a flat-rate app at $19/month is already the cheaper option. The overwhelming majority of operating barbershops and salons cross this threshold every single week." data-fr="En termes simples : si votre salon attire plus de 2 nouveaux clients par mois — à tout prix de service typique — une application à tarif fixe à 19$/mois est déjà l'option moins chère. La grande majorité des barbershops et salons en activité franchissent ce seuil chaque semaine.">In plain terms: if your shop attracts more than 2 new clients per month — at any typical service price — a flat-rate app at $19/month is already the cheaper option. The overwhelming majority of operating barbershops and salons cross this threshold every single week.</p>

      <h2 data-en="Beyond Price — The Marketplace Problem" data-fr="Au-delà du prix — le problème du marketplace">Beyond Price — The Marketplace Problem</h2>

      <p data-en="The cost comparison alone makes a strong case for flat-rate. But there is a second issue with commission-based marketplace apps that goes beyond what you pay per month: they list your business alongside your direct competitors." data-fr="La comparaison des coûts seule plaide fortement en faveur du tarif fixe. Mais il y a un deuxième problème avec les applications marketplace à commission qui dépasse ce que vous payez par mois : elles répertorient votre entreprise à côté de vos concurrents directs.">The cost comparison alone makes a strong case for flat-rate. But there is a second issue with commission-based marketplace apps that goes beyond what you pay per month: they list your business alongside your direct competitors.</p>

      <p data-en="When a client opens the Fresha app looking for a haircut, they see a map of nearby businesses. Your shop is one result among many. A client who started their search intending to book with you can easily be captured by the shop next door that has more reviews, a lower price, or a faster available slot." data-fr="Lorsqu'un client ouvre l'application Fresha pour chercher une coupe de cheveux, il voit une carte des entreprises à proximité. Votre salon est un résultat parmi d'autres. Un client qui a commencé sa recherche avec l'intention de réserver chez vous peut facilement être capturé par le salon d'à côté qui a plus d'avis, un prix inférieur ou un créneau disponible plus rapide.">When a client opens the Fresha app looking for a haircut, they see a map of nearby businesses. Your shop is one result among many. A client who started their search intending to book with you can easily be captured by the shop next door that has more reviews, a lower price, or a faster available slot.</p>

      <p data-en="With a flat-rate app, your booking page is yours alone. Clients who click your link, scan your QR code, or tap your Instagram bio go directly to your booking page — no competitor listings, no distractions, no alternative options presented to them." data-fr="Avec une application à tarif fixe, votre page de réservation vous appartient uniquement. Les clients qui cliquent sur votre lien, scannent votre code QR ou cliquent sur votre bio Instagram accèdent directement à votre page de réservation — pas de listes de concurrents, pas de distractions, pas d'options alternatives présentées.">With a flat-rate app, your booking page is yours alone. Clients who click your link, scan your QR code, or tap your Instagram bio go directly to your booking page — no competitor listings, no distractions, no alternative options presented to them.</p>

      <p data-en="This matters for long-term brand-building. Over time, clients associate the entire booking experience with your business — not with Fresha's or Booksy's brand. That loyalty compounds into repeat bookings and referrals." data-fr="Cela compte pour la construction de la marque à long terme. Au fil du temps, les clients associent toute l'expérience de réservation à votre entreprise — pas à la marque Fresha ou Booksy. Cette fidélité se cumule en réservations répétées et recommandations.">This matters for long-term brand-building. Over time, clients associate the entire booking experience with your business — not with Fresha's or Booksy's brand. That loyalty compounds into repeat bookings and referrals.</p>

      <h2 data-en="Who Should Use Which Model — An Honest Assessment" data-fr="Qui devrait utiliser quel modèle — une évaluation honnête">Who Should Use Which Model — An Honest Assessment</h2>

      <p data-en="Commission-based apps like Fresha are not without merit. Here is an honest breakdown of who genuinely benefits from each model:" data-fr="Les applications à commission comme Fresha ne sont pas sans mérite. Voici une analyse honnête de qui bénéficie véritablement de chaque modèle :">Commission-based apps like Fresha are not without merit. Here is an honest breakdown of who genuinely benefits from each model:</p>

      <h3 data-en="Commission-based may be the right starting point if:" data-fr="La commission peut être le bon point de départ si :">Commission-based may be the right starting point if:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li data-en="You are opening your very first location with zero existing clients and zero marketing budget." data-fr="Vous ouvrez votre tout premier emplacement sans client existant et sans budget marketing.">You are opening your very first location with zero existing clients and zero marketing budget.</li>
        <li data-en="You need marketplace discovery to bring in your first handful of clients before word-of-mouth kicks in." data-fr="Vous avez besoin de la découverte marketplace pour attirer vos premiers clients avant que le bouche-à-oreille ne commence.">You need marketplace discovery to bring in your first handful of clients before word-of-mouth kicks in.</li>
        <li data-en="You genuinely attract fewer than 2 new clients per month — meaning the commission costs less than $19 and flat-rate would cost more." data-fr="Vous attirez réellement moins de 2 nouveaux clients par mois — ce qui signifie que la commission coûte moins de 19$ et que le tarif fixe coûterait plus cher.">You genuinely attract fewer than 2 new clients per month — meaning the commission costs less than $19 and flat-rate would cost more.</li>
        <li data-en="You have a clear plan to switch to flat-rate within the first 3 to 6 months as your client base grows." data-fr="Vous avez un plan clair pour passer au tarif fixe dans les 3 à 6 premiers mois à mesure que votre clientèle se développe.">You have a clear plan to switch to flat-rate within the first 3 to 6 months as your client base grows.</li>
      </ul>

      <h3 data-en="Flat-rate is almost certainly better for you if:" data-fr="Le tarif fixe est presque certainement meilleur pour vous si :">Flat-rate is almost certainly better for you if:</h3>
      <ul>
        <li data-en="Your shop is already open and already attracting new clients through any channel." data-fr="Votre salon est déjà ouvert et attire déjà de nouveaux clients via n'importe quel canal.">Your shop is already open and already attracting new clients through any channel.</li>
        <li data-en="You have any social media presence, a Google Business listing, or word-of-mouth referrals coming in." data-fr="Vous avez une présence sur les réseaux sociaux, une fiche Google Business ou des recommandations de bouche-à-oreille.">You have any social media presence, a Google Business listing, or word-of-mouth referrals coming in.</li>
        <li data-en="You manage 2 or more staff — commission scales with every additional barber who attracts new clients." data-fr="Vous gérez 2 membres du personnel ou plus — la commission s'adapte à chaque barbier supplémentaire qui attire de nouveaux clients.">You manage 2 or more staff — commission scales with every additional barber who attracts new clients.</li>
        <li data-en="You care about brand ownership and do not want your clients browsing your competitors in the same booking app." data-fr="Vous vous souciez de la propriété de votre marque et ne voulez pas que vos clients parcourent vos concurrents dans la même application de réservation.">You care about brand ownership and do not want your clients browsing your competitors in the same booking app.</li>
        <li data-en="You want predictable software costs that do not increase as your business grows more successful." data-fr="Vous souhaitez des coûts logiciels prévisibles qui n'augmentent pas au fur et à mesure que votre entreprise se développe.">You want predictable software costs that do not increase as your business grows more successful.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2 data-en="The Verdict: 1-Year and 3-Year Total Cost of Ownership" data-fr="Le verdict : coût total de possession sur 1 an et 3 ans">The Verdict: 1-Year and 3-Year Total Cost of Ownership</h2>

